                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Nightdive Studios has been absolutely killing it with these remasters, and Forsaken Remastered is another great example of why I'm glad they're bringing classic games back. It's an old-school FPS with fast-paced action, unique environments, and that classic late-'90s feel that you just don't get from many modern shooters. The zero-gravity movement gives the gameplay its own identity, making combat feel different from your typical run-and-gun FPS. There's a learning curve to getting comfortable with the movement, but once you get the hang of it, flying around and taking out enemies is a lot of fun. What I appreciate most is that Nightdive Studios understands the importance of preserving these games while making them more accessible on modern hardware. These remasters give older games another chance to find an audience instead of letting them disappear into gaming history.",
